 blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/c7d01b9865618c5786d76b15e108953f.poster.avif?t=1768978976\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/c7d01b9865618c5786d76b15e108953f.webm?t=1768978976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/c7d01b9865618c5786d76b15e108953f.mp4?t=1768978976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also merge the blocks inside the watermelon (though it's not easy!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/2372b58e7c217388cffa817329f934b2.poster.avif?t=1768978976\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/2372b58e7c217388cffa817329f934b2.webm?t=1768978976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540460/extras/2372b58e7c217388cffa817329f934b2.mp4?t=1768978976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, as you might accidentally drop more blocks out of the container if you're not careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bgm: spring day by syncopika, CC-BY 3.0, from </p>","developers":["SillyOven"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/